      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BULLETPROOF BOY (8) was brave when fifth behind wonder mare Captains Mistress in the Victoria Cup at this circuit and distance last start and came from wider on this row to win the Smoken Up Sprint here prior. Draws for a trail and will be hard to stop with racing room. CATCH A WAVE (7) was just over 4m behind BULLETPROOF BOY in the Victoria Cup. Overcame a wide draw on the back row to win here prior. He is a major player as is SIR JIMMY (3) who worked from wider in the Smoken Up Sprint last start and had a series of second line barriers prior so is better served by this draw. HES FROM HEAVEN NZ (4) is first up for three months but was racing consistently before the spell and was readied with two trials. He can feature along with JILLIBY NITRO (6) who claimed some big scalps in his Geelong Cup win two back.",
